Z||000000||DaveL||05-21-2001||07:56 AM||||No, I'm not going to make any bad jokes about exhaust manifolds, just got a question. I developed a sudden nasty tick in my 87 SE 2.5, and suspect the exhaust manifold may be cracked, Have'nt had a chance to really get under there and do the hose test to locate the exact location of the noise yet.<P>Is it possible for a crack to cause this type of noise? Also where is the most likely place one would break? Is this a common problem? Isn't this a lot of questions?<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrossum||05-21-2001||09:02 AM||||they crack all the time. i weld 3 or 4 a month. easy to fix.........||||reg||3
Z||000002||87GTZ34||05-21-2001||09:21 AM||||Either a cracked manifold or a burned out manifold gasket.  Either way it is fun to work on... ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Formula88||05-21-2001||09:37 AM||||Has anyone tried the shorty style headers from West Coast Fiero?  I hate to weld up a manifold that'll just crack again.  Besides, the performance improvement would be nice.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I read that Oreif has the Sprint manifolds - but for the money, I'd probably go with the West Coast headers.  Any experiences anyone?||||reg||1
Z||000004||stsmithgt||05-21-2001||03:00 PM||||I'm getting a couple exhaust manifolds modified right now to rid myself of  those damn leaks.  The front manifold had been replaced twice with all new parts. And still ends up leaking within a year or so.  The head surface is fine.  It's those manifold warping that blows out the gasket on mine. If this next fix doesn't shut the leaks down, I'll have to think hard about where all my money has been going.$$$?  I've never needed to spend so much money on a single car.  An exhuast leak can make even the nicest car seem like a piece of crap just from it sounding so bad.  Ooops, ranting,..... later. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>My heap. No, it's not missing the "C".<BR>Those are notes that I spend on it.<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/carpicsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
